<div class="container">
	<div class="columns">
		<div class="fullwidth_column">
			<div id="post-29" class="post_box grt top">
				<div class="headline_area">
					<h1 class="headline">Haunted</h1>
				</div>
				<div class="post_content">
<h5>The Zombie Harvest</h5>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignright size-full wp-image-66" src="https://auroramaize.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/zombie_bite_crop.jpg" alt="zombie_bite_crop" width="250" height="246" />Climb aboard the army truck to test your trigger finger on the rogue zombies that roam these woods.</p>
<p>Get 100 glow-in-the-dark paintballs for $15 &#8230; additional 50 paintballs for $5.  Do both the maze and zombie harvest with a combo ticket for $25. Buy extra rounds at the ticket window or cash accepted on the trucks.</p>
<h5>Field of Screams</h5>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignright size-full wp-image-67" src="https://auroramaize.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/corn_stalker.jpg" alt="corn_stalker" width="250" height="188" />The maze Haunting begins on Friday, September 25.  Then every Friday, and Saturday at dark until October 31, which is our last day of the season!  Wednesday night hauntings begin Oct 7 thru Oct 28.</p>
<h5>Campfires</h5>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignright size-full wp-image-62" src="https://auroramaize.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/campfire_OPT.jpg" alt="campfire_OPT" width="250" height="167" />What says &#8220;fall&#8221; more than a crackly campfire?<br />
Reserve a spot for your group to roast hot dogs and marshmallows &#8212; or to just gather and tell stories &#8212; or be a meeting spot for the day!</p>
<p>$12.00 per hour by reservation.  Go to <a href="https://auroramaize.com/group-reservations/">Reservations</a> to submit your reservation or call 417-489-1220 with any questions.  Weekends in October fill up so call soon.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="footer">
		<div class="text_box foot_textBox">
			Aurora Maize: 20591 County Rd. 2200 | Aurora, MO  65605 <br />Phone: 417-489-1220 | Hotline: 417-236-6714
